	<entry>
		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  createdb: could not connect to database postgres]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=2827#p2827"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>postgres@deb1:~$ ps aux | grep postgres<br />postgres 31176&#160; 0.0&#160; 0.2&#160; &#160;2812&#160; 1416 pts/2&#160; &#160; S&#160; &#160; 16:28&#160; &#160;0:00 su - postgres<br />postgres 31253&#160; 0.0&#160; 0.3&#160; &#160;2920&#160; 1564 pts/2&#160; &#160; R&#160; &#160; 16:28&#160; &#160;0:00 -su<br />postgres 31256&#160; 0.0&#160; 0.1&#160; &#160;2328&#160; &#160;908 pts/2&#160; &#160; R+&#160; &#160;16:28&#160; &#160;0:00 ps aux<br />postgres 31257&#160; 0.0&#160; 0.1&#160; &#160;1752&#160; &#160;548 pts/2&#160; &#160; S+&#160; &#160;16:28&#160; &#160;0:00 grep postgres</p><p>En faisant lsof -n -p (id) il me marque pour tous :<br />-su: lsof: command not found</p>]]></content>
